# =====================================================================
# Tiered Tenant Quota Prototype
#   /gateway    Java 21, Spring Boot, Gradle Kotlin DSL
#   /dashboard  React + TypeScript + Vite (served by nginx)
#   /generator  Node.js + TypeScript (run directly, no build)
#   docker compose, Redis, scripts in /scripts
# =====================================================================

